DESCRIPTION:We’re Popping Up Near You!\nPre-order your frozen casseroles an
	d pick them up on select Fridays in August.\n\nPURCHASE YOURS TODAY for Br
	ookwood Casserole Delivery Days – Katy Area Pickup!\nPre-order now and pic
	k up Friday\, August 21 | 5:00–6:30pm📍 Kingsland Baptist Church – 20555 Ki
	ngsland Blvd\, Katy\, TX 77450 \n\nBack-to-school chaos? We’ve got dinner 
	covered. \nOur Citizens at The Brookwood Community™ know August can feel l
	ike a marathon of carpools\, college move-ins\, and teacher meet-and-greet
	s. That’s why we’re making life easier—and more delicious—with Brookwood C
	asserole Delivery Days! \n✅ Three delicious frozen casseroles to choose fr
	om✅ Pre-order online\, then swing by and pick up on your way home✅ Serve 2
	–4 people – perfect for busy weeknights✅ Support adults with disabilities 
	who live and work with purpose at Brookwood \n\n🍴 Your Casserole Lineup:\n
	🥘 Beef & Spinach LasagnaSeasoned beef\, ricotta\, mushrooms\, basil\, and 
	penne pasta layered into savory perfection. \n🌮 Fiesta Chicken EnchiladaRo
	asted chicken\, sweet corn\, black beans\, queso fresco\, Latin-style red 
	sauce\, and cheese between layers of corn tortillas. \n🐔 King Ranch Chicke
	n – we brought back a Brookwood FAVORITE!Texas comfort classic made with t
	ender chicken\, tomatoes\, green chiles\, layered tortillas\, and creamy c
	heesy goodness in every bite. \n\n💵 $35 each | Bulk Order Discounts:\n\nBu
	y 5+ and save 5% with code: 5CASS\nBuy 10+ and save 10% with code: 10CASS\
	n\n\nDinner made easy. Purpose made powerful.Thank you for helping change 
	the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities. \n🗓️ Want to know 
	where we’ll be next?Visit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of Bro
	okwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n \n\nhttps://brookwoodcommunity.org/even
	t/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-katy-area-aug-21/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Ma
	rket
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-k
	aty-area-aug-21/
LOCATION:Kingsland Baptist Church\, 20555 Kingsland Blvd.\, Katy\, TX\, 774
	50\, United States
