SUMMARY:Fall Container Workshop Lunch and Learn Aug 28
DTSTAMP:20260818T032839Z
DTSTART:20260828T103000Z
DESCRIPTION:Autumn Blooms & Lunch at Brookwood\n  \nFall Container Garden W
	orkshop with Brookwood’s Horticulture Manager\, Robert Grove\nJoin Brookwo
	od Horticulture Manager Robert Grove for a hands-on Fall Container Garden 
	Workshop that celebrates the beauty of the season. You’ll design and plant
	 your own stunning autumn-inspired container garden using plants lovingly 
	grown by Brookwood Citizens right here on campus. \nWhether you’re a seaso
	ned gardener or just ready to try something new\, Robert will share expert
	 tips\, creative inspiration\, and easy techniques to help your fall arran
	gement thrive all season long. Best of all\, you’ll head home with a beaut
	iful custom container garden you created yourself! \nBefore the workshop b
	egins\, enjoy a fresh and delicious meal at The Brookwood Café\, where eve
	ry bite supports the mission of The Brookwood Community and empowers adult
	s with disabilities to live lives of purpose and meaning. \n\nTwo sessions
	 to choose from on Friday\, August 28 \n\n10:30 AM\nNoon\n\nBrookwood Café
	\n1502 FM 1489\nBrookshire. TX 77423 \nGrab your tickets here!\n  \n\nThan
	k you for supporting the beloved adults with disABILITIES who live and wor
	k at Brookwood!\n \nVisit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of Bro
	okwood’s upcoming events.   \nChanging the way the world thinks about adul
	ts with disabilities\n\nhttps://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/fall-containe
	r-workshop-lunch-and-learn-aug-28/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Market
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/fall-container-workshop-lunch-and-
	learn-aug-28/
LOCATION:Brookwood Gift & Garden Center & Café\, 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\
	, TX\, 77423\, United States
