SUMMARY:The Brookwood Way Conference Sept 22-24
DTSTAMP:20260818T032839Z
DTSTART:20260921T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience The Brookwood Way – A Conference That Changes Everyt
	hing\nSeptember 21–25\, 2026 from 8:30am–4:00pm at The Brookwood Community
	\, Brookshire\, Texas\nThis three-day conference provides an engaging\, be
	hind-the-scenes experience designed to fully immerse participants in our c
	ulture\, methodology\, and practices\, which we call The Brookwood Way. \n
	Discover a proven\, purpose-driven model that empowers adults with disabil
	ities to live with dignity\, purpose\, and meaningful work. The Brookwood 
	Way Conference is an immersive\, behind-the-scenes experience at The Brook
	wood Community in Brookshire\, Texas\, created for leaders\, families\, no
	nprofits\, ministries\, and organizations seeking to build or strengthen t
	hriving communities for adults with disabilities. \nExperience The Brookwo
	od Way firsthand as you tour our campus\, connect with our leadership team
	\, and see a living model in action. You’ll leave inspired and equipped wi
	th practical ideas\, proven strategies\, and adaptable tools to help creat
	e communities where adults with disabilities can flourish. \nWho should at
	tend? \n\nIndividuals and organizations that are serving or desire to serv
	e adults with disabilities\nProfessionals who desire to create more opport
	unities for people with disabilities or other underserved populations\nTea
	chers\, administrators\, parents\, church groups\, healthcare professional
	s\, non-profits or anyone seeking inspiration to make a difference\n\n$495
	 Early Bird Pricing (Conference Fee after Sept. 1—$550 per person) \nREGIS
	TER TODAY\nWhat If Three Days Isn’t Enough?\nThere are two PRE-Conference 
	sessions and two POST-Conference sessions available! \nChoose a PRE-Confer
	ence Experience for Monday\, Sept. 21:\n\nSatellite Immersion Opportunity 
	– Get Inspired. See it in action! REGISTER HERE\nA unique pre-conference s
	ite visit to one of our Satellite Work Programs designed to provide a real
	-world glimpse into what a Brookwood-inspired start-up can look like. Both
	 locations are generously donated spaces\, reflecting our commitment to fi
	scal stewardship\, and each visit includes a guided tour\, time observing 
	our Citizens at work\, and lunch with a Brookwood leader who will share in
	sights on startup strategy and building a mission-led program. OR\nIntrodu
	ction to Handbells Workshop – Add music to your conference! REGISTER HERE\
	nLearn the basics of teaching handbells using a Brookwood-developed method
	\, including proper technique for ringing handbells and handchimes and an 
	introduction to reading adaptive notation. Helps you discover if this is a
	n experience you would like to offer to those you serve.\n\nChoose a POST-
	Conference Experience for Friday\, Sept. 25:\n\nFundraising Essentials Cou
	rse – Go Behind the Scenes with Brookwood’s Development Team! REGISTER HER
	E\nLearn proven fundraising strategies from Brookwood’s Development Team\,
	 covering donor cultivation\, foundation relationships\, peer-to-peer fund
	raising\, events\, volunteer engagement\, and donor management systems. OR
	 \n\nFundamentals of Citizen Life – Go Beyond the Tour and See how We Crea
	te Community REGISTER HERE\nAn in-depth look at the divisions that make up
	 Citizen Life at Brookwood: Residential\, Work Program\, Spiritual Life\, 
	Admissions\, Medical\, and Activities. Led by our department leaders\, wit
	h time for Q&A.\n\n  \nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with di
	sABILITIES who live and work at Brookwood! \nChanging the way the world th
	inks about adults with disabilities \nVisit our Events Calendar for the fu
	ll schedule of Brookwood’s upcoming events.  \n\nhttps://brookwoodcommunit
	y.org/event/the-brookwood-way-conference-sept-22-24/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Ma
	rket
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/the-brookwood-way-conference-sept-
	22-24/
LOCATION:The Brookwood Community Main Campus\, 1752 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, 
	TX\, 77423\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:nutcracker-market
CATEGORIES:Nutcracker Market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT104H
END:VEVENT
