SUMMARY:Bulbs for the Gulf Coast Lunch and Learn Sept. 25
DTSTAMP:20260818T032839Z
DTSTART:20260925T103000Z
DESCRIPTION:Planting for Beautiful Seasonal Color\nJoin us for the Bulbs fo
	r the Gulf Coast Lunch & Learn at The Brookwood Café! Discover how to sele
	ct\, plant\, and care for beautiful bulbs that thrive in Gulf Coast landsc
	apes and bring lasting color to your garden throughout the seasons. \nEnjo
	y a delicious lunch while our gardening experts share practical tips\, sea
	sonal planting advice\, and creative inspiration to help your bulbs flouri
	sh in Texas gardens. Plus\, each guest will receive a special take-home gi
	ft to continue the experience at home. \nGather your friends and join us f
	or an afternoon of great food\, gardening inspiration\, and blooming possi
	bilities! \nJoin us Friday\, September 25\, 2026 at 10:30 AM \nBrookwood C
	afé\n1502 FM 1489\nBrookshire. TX 77423 \nRegister Here! \n\n$45.00 (plus 
	tax) includes a delicious lunch at the Brookwood Café.\nParticipants will 
	receive a special\, take-home gift!\nPLEASE NOTE:  If you would like to si
	t with specific people\, please be sure to leave a note with their names i
	n the Notes section when you check out.\n\n  \n  \nCANCELLATION POLICY: \n
	\nFull Refund (100%): Requests made 7 or more days before the event date w
	ill be eligible for a full refund.\nPartial Refund (50%): Requests made be
	tween 6 days and 48 hours before the event date will be eligible for a 50%
	 refund.\nNo Refund: Requests made less than 48 hours before the event or 
	on the same day as the event will not be eligible for a refund.\n\n\n  \n\
	nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with disABILITIES who live an
	d work at Brookwood!\n \nVisit our Events Calendar for the full schedule o
	f Brookwood’s upcoming events.   \nChanging the way the world thinks about
	 adults with disabilities\n\nhttps://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/bulbs-fo
	r-the-gulf-coast-lunch-and-learn-sept-25/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Market
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/bulbs-for-the-gulf-coast-lunch-and
	-learn-sept-25/
LOCATION:Brookwood Gift & Garden Center & Café\, 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\
	, TX\, 77423\, United States
